  "definition": "Inconsistent Use Improvements",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-08",
  "historyNote": "#5231, eff 9-27-91; ss by #5353, eff 3-12-92; ss by #6692, eff 2-21-98; ss by #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14; ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
